t.\",\n      \"alternativeComparison\": \"This alternative presses an old friendship across new professional status; alternative b restores a sibling bond after the secret's exclusivity is challenged.\",\n      \"reason\": \"Added a reunion and B's headmaster role. Separate reread: fidelity 5 (A1 first day, A5 secret-based trust), logic 5 (B4 staff table prompts adjacent seat request), relationship 4 (B has formal duties), heightening 4 (A5 brings friendship into staff seating), specificity 5 (A1 reunion), brevity 3 (A5 repeats headmaster): 90. All dialogue gates pass.\",\n      \"reservation\": \"A3 attributes a vocal response not specified by B's words; it is playable as A's hopeful interpretation rather than a required action.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"exampleId\": \"S127-single-b\",\n      \"beforeHash\": \"f3cb6d642c91f31ef61079ce1fecefcbb5dfb2bafb42e497e0fb510e60a6f4bd\",\n      \"firstPass\": {\n        \"ratings\": {\n          \"cardFidelity\": {\"score\": 4, \"evidence\": \"A1 revives a childhood signal and A3 values exclusive knowledge, but A5 shifts toward secret-club membership.\"},\n          \"responseLogic\": {\"score\": 4, \"evidence\": \"A3 answers B2's nobody-cares objection; A5 incorporates B4's revelation about Mum.\"},\n          \"relationship\": {\"score\": 3, \"evidence\": \"B2 punctures the ritual and B4 corrects A, but their present connection is not explored.\"},\n          \"heightening\": {\"score\": 2, \"evidence\": \"A5 adds Mum as a senior member without deepening the siblings' continuing bond.\"},\n          \"specificity\": {\"score\": 4, \"evidence\": \"A1's two knocks and biscuit tin give a concrete childhood secret.\"},\n          \"brevityWit\": {\"score\": 4, \"evidence\": \"A5's senior-member line responds neatly to Mum, though it changes the emotional focus.\"}\n        },\n        \"weightedTotal\": 71\n      },\n      \"beats\": [\n        {\"speaker\": \"A\", \"text\": \"Before we pack Mum's biscuit tin, knock twice. That